L23: LangGraph is very low-level, and focused entirely on agent orchestration. Before using LangGraph, we recommend you familiarize yourself with some of the components used to build agents, starting with cite14†models and cite15†tools . We will commonly use cite7†LangChain components throughout the documentation to integrate models and tools, but you don’t need to use LangChain to use LangGraph.
